The launchpad contracts in src/ (Launchpad, LaunchpadToken, Gauge, ReferralHandler, ReferralRouter,
AccessRegistry, curves/ConstantProductCurve, curves/ICurve and interfaces/IAccessRegistry) are derived
from the launchpad by BowTiedPickle verified on Robinhood Chain, released under the MIT License:

  Launchpad              0x1badc838aae6ac41829180744ea2e1c89b452aae
  LaunchpadToken         0x9fe6Ad6A2334Ee380a4D17C92D81FAf5F9924eFD
  ReferralHandler        0xBE42c00c7E4aDdf133D3bFe74f1Ef7279c53F139
  AccessRegistry         0xf9db4fed8bb8c31177752eb5841597d368ee921b
  ConstantProductCurve   0x48bf6a9d8636e75be9a853b74833db68f5c8d0e7

AccessRegistry, ConstantProductCurve, ICurve and IAccessRegistry are copied unchanged apart from the
pragma. The gauges graduate into Uniswap v4 instead of v2 and set aside a share of each fee for the
token's creator.

